<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- The app: not App-Sandboxed (ADR-0140). A sandboxed app cannot register the unsandboxed agent
     Postgres needs, so the one rule the sandbox was for, that nothing which reads the music can
     write it, is enforced on the Python server by a Seatbelt profile (ServerLaunch) instead.
     Hardened runtime, Developer ID, notarized; no exceptions. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
